# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal and employer data — deliberately not published.
#
# This repo is public for the pipeline architecture. The data it runs on
# is Matt's actual career record and, in the NICB material, his
# employer's internal systems (warehouse architecture, accuracy targets,
# production incidents, carrier pilots). None of that is needed to
# understand or run the code, and publishing an employer's internals
# under your own name is a different risk from publishing your own phone
# number. Templates with the same shape ship in examples/ instead.
#
# Everything here is still in your local working tree — ignored, not
# deleted.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
